   "title": "Police showcase weapons, security measures at Open House for students",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/andhra-pradesh/police-showcase-weapons-security-measures-at-open-house-for-students/article71620580.ece",
   "domain": "thehindu.com",
