   "published": "Sat, 24 Oct 2026 17:03:54 +0000",
   "_dt": 1792861434.0,
   "ageDays": 0.03,
   "summary": "National Publicity Secretary of the NDC, Osa Director in a statement on Saturday said the NEC takes at JD event centre, Kashim Ibrahim Way, opposite A-class park, Maitama , Abuja at 10 am prompt. He said a major highlight of the meeting will be the release and presentation of the party’s Statement of Account by the National Treasurer. According to him, the party will also use the opportunity of the NEC meeting to unveil its National Campaign Council (NCC).",
   "summary_zh": "全国民主大会（NDC）全国宣传书记兼奥斯阿主任星期六发表声明称，该党全国执行委员会（NEC）将于上午10时在阿布贾迈塔马A类公园对面、卡希姆·易卜拉欣路JD活动中心准时举行。他说，本次会议的一大亮点将是全国财务主管发布并介绍该党的账户报表。他还表示，该党还将借全国执行委员会会议之机公布全国竞选委员会（NCC）。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "National Publicity Secretary of the NDC, Osa Director in a statement on Saturday said the NEC takes at JD event centre, Kashim Ibrahim Way, opposite A-class park, Maitama , Abuja at 10 am prompt. He said a major highlight of the meeting will be the release and presentation of the party’s Statement of Account by the National Treasurer. “This is in deference to our avowed commitment to the principles of transparency and accountability. “In this regard, we challenge other political parties, especially the ruling All Progressives Congress (APC), to emulate this level of openness and transparency in the management of their finances. “For the NDC, it is no longer politics as usual. Our finances would have been more robust. However, contrary to speculations in the public domain, and due to the level of poverty, hunger and deprivation in the country occasioned by the rudderless APC and its amorphous economic policies, about 80% of our candidates could not afford the Expression of Interest forms. The party had to issue forms to such candidates free of charge,” Director said. According to him, the party will also use the opportunity of the NEC meeting to unveil its National Campaign Council (NCC). “As a party of innovation, our NCC is all-encompassing. It covers the Presidential, National Assembly, Governorship, and State Houses of Assembly Campaign Councils. “Our various candidates will be presented with Certificates of Return for their respective offices. The NDC is turbo-charged and ready to give Nigerians the altruistic leadership the nation deserves,” Director added. We’ve got the edge. Get real-time reports, breaking scoops, and exclusive angles delivered straight to your phone. Don’t settle for stale news. Join LEADERSHIP NEWS on WhatsApp for 24/7 updates →",
