   "title": "Passenger association seeks memorial stupa at Podanur Railway Junction in remembrance of ‘Wagon Tragedy’",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/Coimbatore/passenger-association-seeks-memorial-stupa-at-podanur-railway-junction-in-remembrance-of-wagon-tragedy/article71620583.ece",
   "domain": "thehindu.com",
   "source": "thehindu.com",
   "published": "Sat, 24 Oct 2026 22:32:45 +0530",
   "_dt": 1792861365.0,
   "ageDays": 0.03,
   "summary": "Unlock these with Subscription The Podanur Train Users’ Association has sought permission from the Southern Railway to establish a memorial stupa at the Podanur Railway Junction in remembrance of the 1921 Wagon Tragedy. Subramanian said the ‘Wagon Tragedy’ took place when several freedom fighters imprisoned for Malabar Rebellion and transported in a closed railway goods wagon from Tirur Railway Station to Podanur Railway Junction had died of suffocation before reaching the destination.",
   "summary_zh": "订阅即可解锁。波达努尔列车用户协会已请求南方铁路公司批准，在波达努尔铁路枢纽设立纪念佛塔，以纪念1921年“货车惨案”。苏布拉马尼亚恩说，“货车惨案”发生时，数名因马拉巴尔起义而入狱的自由战士被关在封闭的铁路货车中，从蒂鲁尔火车站运往波达努尔铁路枢纽，最终因窒息而未能抵达目的地。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Account subscription benefits alongside Premium Stories, Editorials, Opinions and more. Unlock these with Subscription The Podanur Train Users’ Association has sought permission from the Southern Railway to establish a memorial stupa at the Podanur Railway Junction in remembrance of the 1921 Wagon Tragedy. In a representation to the General Manager of Southern Railway U. Subba Rao, association general secretary N. Subramanian said the ‘Wagon Tragedy’ took place when several freedom fighters imprisoned for Malabar Rebellion and transported in a closed railway goods wagon from Tirur Railway Station to Podanur Railway Junction had died of suffocation before reaching the destination. The Wagon Tragedy is an important and painful chapter in the history of India’s freedom struggle, he said. As in Tirur Railway Station, a memorial stupa should be permitted at Podanur Railway Junction, preferably at a suitable location near the entrance within the railway premises, Mr. Subramanian said. The memorial will be a fitting tribute to the brave freedom fighters and would help preserve the memory of their sacrifice for generations to come, he said. Comments have to be in English, and in full sentences. They cannot be abusive or personal. Please abide by our community guidelines for posting your comments. We have migrated to a new commenting platform. If you are already a registered user of The Hindu and logged in, you may continue to engage with our articles. If you do not have an account please register and login to post comments. Users can access their older comments by logging into their accounts on Vuukle",
