   "title": "IMD warns of heavy rainfall over several T.N. districts; red alert for five districts in Keralam",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/bay-of-bengal-weather-update-cyclone-alert-latest-weather-news-live-updates-october-24-2026/article71619022.ece",
