   "title": "Steps initiated to establish telemedicine programme in Tamil Nadu",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/chennai/steps-initiated-to-establish-telemedicine-programme-in-tamil-nadu/article71616410.ece",
   "domain": "thehindu.com",
