   "title": "Anyone who rigs 2027 poll will die, Omo-Agege warns",
   "url": "https://punchng.com/anyone-who-rigs-2027-poll-will-die-omo-agege-warns/",
   "domain": "punchng.com",
   "source": "Punch（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Fri, 23 Oct 2026 23:08:05 +0000",
   "_dt": 1792796885.0,
   "ageDays": 0.78,
   "summary": "Former Deputy President of the Senate and Nigeria Democratic Congress senatorial candidate for Delta Central Senatorial District, Senator Ovie Omo-Agege, has warned prospective election riggers to avoid such nefarious actions as the 2027 general elections approach. Omo-Agege, while flagging off his campaign in Uvwie Local Government Area of Delta State on Friday, declared pointedly that whoever rigs the election will die.",
   "summary_zh": "尼日利亚前参议院副议长、尼日利亚民主大会党三角洲中部选区参议员候选人奥维·奥莫-阿格吉警告，临近2027年大选之际，意图操纵选举者应停止此类邪恶行径。奥莫-阿格吉星期五在三角洲州Uvwie地方政府为竞选活动揭幕时明确宣称，任何操纵选举的人都将死去。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Former Deputy President of the Senate and Nigeria Democratic Congress senatorial candidate for Delta Central Senatorial District, Senator Ovie Omo-Agege, has warned prospective election riggers to avoid such nefarious actions as the 2027 general elections approach. Omo-Agege, while flagging off his campaign in Uvwie Local Government Area of Delta State on Friday, declared pointedly that whoever rigs the election will die. ”It’s rig and die. Anybody who tries to rig the 2027 election will face the consequences. We will not allow anyone to steal our votes,” he said. According to the former Deputy President of the Senate, the era of ballot manipulation and electoral fraud is over as the people are now more conscious and ready to defend their votes. Omo-Agege, however, boasted that the NDC would defeat the All Progressives Congress in Delta State in the forthcoming general elections while calling on supporters to mobilise for his senatorial bid and other NDC candidates. Dele Ogunyemi is a journalist at Punch Newspapers with over 25 years of experience in media practice. He began his career at Radio Nigeria, Ikoyi, Lagos, and has since held editorial positions across several provincial and national newspapers. His work reflects extensive newsroom expertise and a long-standing commitment to professional journalism standards",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
   "country": [
    "ng"
   ],
   "topic": [
    "pol"
   ],
   "tier": 3,
   "actor": "当事国政府",
   "alsoUS": false,
   "cnHit": false,
