   "_dt": 1792759196.0,
   "ageDays": 1.22,
   "summary": "The Minister of Works, David Umahi, has disclosed that the 750km Lagos-Calabar Coastal Highway has no single engineering design for the entire route. Read More: https://punchng.com/lagos-calabar-highway-has-no-single-engineering-design-umahi/",
