   "title": "Gombe passes state police bill",
   "url": "https://punchng.com/gombe-passes-state-police-bill/",
   "domain": "punchng.com",
   "source": "Punch（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Fri, 23 Oct 2026 01:46:29 +0000",
   "_dt": 1792719989.0,
   "ageDays": 1.67,
   "summary": "The Gombe State House of Assembly has unanimously supported the establishment of state police, aligning its position with that of the National Assembly. The Chairman of the House Committee on Information and member Ad Hoc Committee on State Police, Musa Buba, disclosed this shortly after the lawmakers reached the decision, on Thursday. Buba, who also serves as the Chief Whip of the Assembly, said the House had adopted the position in support of establishing state police.",
   "summary_zh": "戈姆贝州议会一致支持设立州警察，使该州立场与国民议会保持一致。州议会信息委员会主席兼州警察特设委员会成员Musa Buba于议员们周四作出决定后不久透露了这一点。兼任州议会首席党鞭的Buba表示，州议会已采纳支持设立州警察的立场。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "The Gombe State House of Assembly has unanimously supported the establishment of state police, aligning its position with that of the National Assembly. The Chairman of the House Committee on Information and member Ad Hoc Committee on State Police, Musa Buba, disclosed this shortly after the lawmakers reached the decision, on Thursday. Buba, who also serves as the Chief Whip of the Assembly, said the House had adopted the position in support of establishing state police. “We’ve passed it just now. Thus, we unanimously concurred with the position of the National Assembly. In other words, we collectively supported the establishment of state police,” he said",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
