   "url": "https://x.com/brane_mija64426/status/2113731220739645896",
   "snippet": "🇮🇳🇨🇳 India and China are still facing off in Arunachal Pradesh\n\nIndia has officially confirmed that its troops are still involved in face-offs with the Chinese military at several points along the Arunachal Pradesh border.\n\nOne of the main flashpoints is near Taksing in Upper Subansiri, where tensions have continued since July. Indian reports previously claimed that Chinese troops had set up tents several kilometres inside territory claimed by India.\n\nAnd this never really stopped during the recent India-China rapprochement.\n\nXi Jinping visited India for the BRICS summit, officials held more border talks and both sides talked about improving relations.\n\nMeanwhile, their troops were still blocking each other in Arunachal Pradesh.",
   "body": "🇮🇳🇨🇳 India and China are still facing off in Arunachal Pradesh\n\nIndia has officially confirmed that its troops are still involved in face-offs with the Chinese military at several points along the Arunachal Pradesh border.\n\nOne of the main flashpoints is near Taksing in Upper Subansiri, where tensions have continued since July. Indian reports previously claimed that Chinese troops had set up tents several kilometres inside territory claimed by India.\n\nAnd this never really stopped during the recent India-China rapprochement.\n\nXi Jinping visited India for the BRICS summit, officials held more border talks and both sides talked about improving relations.\n\nMeanwhile, their troops were still blocking each other in Arunachal Pradesh.",
