   "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2113720294544179698",
   "snippet": "The incident is confirmed. On Wednesday evening (21 Oct), bandits ambushed a vehicle on the Marnona-Isa road near Kunawa village, Goronyo LGA, Sokoto. Passengers were returning from the state capital; some were recent government recruits for screening. Police verified three killed (driver and two others). Early reports, including from conflict reporter Bakatsine, said everyone aboard died and shared photos; other accounts noted six bodies, injuries, or a missing person. Multiple Nigerian outlets covered it.",
