   "title": "There are currently no plans for a new conversation between Vladimir Putin and Donald Trump, according to Dmitry Peskov.",
   "url": "https://x.com/BeateLandefeld/status/2113400387336118557",
   "snippet": "There are currently no plans for a new conversation between Vladimir Putin and Donald Trump, according to Dmitry Peskov.\n\nHe added that such a conversation could be arranged quickly if both leaders desire it.\n\nKey takeaways from the press secretary's briefing:\nMediation in a complex process like the resolution of the situation in Ukraine is conducted discreetly;\nPutin has not yet made a decision on the composition of the Russian negotiating group in the three-way talks on Ukraine;\nThere are no plans to hold a meeting between Putin and the members of the Russian negotiating group in the three-way talks on Ukraine;\n\"megaphone diplomacy\" can only harm the resolution of the situation in Ukraine;\nA decision on Putin's participation in the G20 summit has not yet been made, and the invitation will be considered;\nThe United States is doing a lot to resolve the situation, while Europe is doing a lot to provoke further military action;\nRussia has not heard a single statement from Europe that would indicate a desire to de-escalate and take Moscow's interests into account;\nRussia sees a positive development in the fact that some European countries are trying to understand Moscow's concerns, but the process does not go beyond that;\nCooperation between Russia and China in the energy sector has untapped potential;\nPutin and Li Qiang did not discuss preparations for a deal on the \"Sila Baykala\" gas pipeline;\nRussia is guided solely by its own interests when making decisions regarding foreign assets.\n\n⚡️Two Majors",
   "body": "There are currently no plans for a new conversation between Vladimir Putin and Donald Trump, according to Dmitry Peskov.\n\nHe added that such a conversation could be arranged quickly if both leaders desire it.\n\nKey takeaways from the press secretary's briefing:\nMediation in a complex process like the resolution of the situation in Ukraine is conducted discreetly;\nPutin has not yet made a decision on the composition of the Russian negotiating group in the three-way talks on Ukraine;\nThere are no plans to hold a meeting between Putin and the members of the Russian negotiating group in the three-way talks on Ukraine;\n\"megaphone diplomacy\" can only harm the resolution of the situation in Ukraine;\nA decision on Putin's participation in the G20 summit has not yet been made, and the invitation will be considered;\nThe United States is doing a lot to resolve the situation, while Europe is doing a lot to provoke further military action;\nRussia has not heard a single statement from Europe that would indicate a desire to de-escalate and take Moscow's interests into account;\nRussia sees a positive development in the fact that some European countries are trying to understand Moscow's concerns, but the process does not go beyond that;\nCooperation between Russia and China in the energy sector has untapped potential;\nPutin and Li Qiang did not discuss preparations for a deal on the \"Sila Baykala\" gas pipeline;\nRussia is guided solely by its own interests when making decisions regarding foreign assets.\n\n⚡️Two Majors",
